  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Organizations Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The local organizations network (LON) for Zambia will maximize the potential impact of USAID resources to improvements in TB services by shifting accountability and ownership to local stakeholders. through the ION support the NTP in cross-cutting areas including training and mentorship, patient information systems, domestic resource mobilization, operations research and commodity management.</narrative>
  </description>
